@startuml
title State machine for Microwave Oven

state "Idle" as Idle
Idle : entry/To action
Idle : do/Remain in same state
Idle : exit/Start cooking / Open door

state "Start Cooking" as StartCooking
StartCooking : entry/Start cooking
StartCooking : do/Set power level and cooking time
StartCooking : exit/Open door / Cancel cooking

state "Cancel Cooking" as CancelCooking
CancelCooking : entry/Cancelling cooking
CancelCooking : do/Stop cooking process
CancelCooking : exit/Return to idle

state "Error" as Error
Error : entry/Error condition
Error : do/Display error message
Error : exit/Return to idle

[*] --> Idle : start_cooking / close_door

Idle --> StartCooking : start_cooking / close_door

StartCooking --> CancelCooking : cancel_cooking / open_door
CancelCooking --> Idle : cooking_stopped / return_to_idle

StartCooking --> Error : door_opened_during_cooking / error_condition
Error --> Idle : error_handled / return_to_idle

Idle --> StartCooking : start_cooking / close_door

Idle --> CancelCooking : cancel_cooking / open_door

CancelCooking --> Idle : cooking_stopped / return_to_idle

StartCooking --> [*] : completion_event

Error --> [*] : completion_event
Idle --> Error : door_opened_during_cooking / error_condition
Idle --> StartCooking : start_cooking / close_door

@enduml
